note Contract section 4 lines 99-101 and errata E2 (unsized parameters on internal functions): the
note slot rule holds for every function of a function-mode unit. Internal g: 3 unsized + 1 scalar = 7 slots,
note error 9 at line 6 (the signature of g, read before the entry f).
om2
fn g a view uchar * b view uchar * c view uchar * d ulong to ulong
ret add d add len a add len b len c
end
fn f a view uchar 4 b view uchar 4 c view uchar 4 to ulong
ret g a b c 1
end
